# The build-site overlay: Build help shows the build markers of the castle's territory, a flag placed changes them in the
# frame that draws it, the Flag button leaves the overlay on, and Build help again takes the markers away.
# Run it on the layout: sh tools/play-run.sh build-help --layout layouts/woodcutter.jsonc --fps 10
# The castle stands at 10,10 with its flag at 11,11.
wait 0.3
shot off 10 12 4 2

button Build help
wait 0.3
shot on 10 12 4 2
shot on-whole

# The Flag button presses with the overlay on and leaves it on; a flag placed takes its node's marker and its
# neighbors' changes.
button Flag
click-tile 8 13
wait 0.3
expect-at 8 13 flag
shot flag 8 13 3 2
shot flag-whole

button Flag
button Build help
wait 0.3
shot off-again 10 12 4 2
dump end
